WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.037
Take a moment to answer the question on the screen before continuing.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:07.927
Ask yourself what temperature actually changes.

00:00:07.927 --> 00:00:14.277
Does it change the model's knowledge, or does it change the shape of the sampling distribution?

00:00:14.277 --> 00:00:20.034
The goal of the checkpoint is to separate model capability from decoding behavior.
